### Step 5 - Observe checkout/order progression
# Requires: accessToken and orderId from step 4.
# Produces: no variable. Run again after a few seconds if the status is still pending.

GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### List this customer's orders
# Requires: accessToken only; the authenticated Customer is derived from the JWT.
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
